WEBVTT

00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:03.690
Huh?

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:05.120
Sexual harassment?

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:06.520
Yes.

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:09.070
We had a complaint
from a girl in your seminar.

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:10.740
Excuse me?

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:14.490
I really have no idea
what you're talking about.

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:16.200
Stop making excuses.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:17.840
Yodogawa-san,

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:21.580
we don't want this to blow up any further.

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.480
Until this blows over,

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.880
why don't you stay in the forest
and concentrate on your research?

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:28.730
"The forest"?

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:35.190
"Nasebanaru" to hito wa yuuga

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:35.190
People say, "Where there's 
a will, there's a way"

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:38.750
Narugamama naseba ii

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:38.750
But things can just be how they'll be

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:51.220
Nagareru kawa ukabu kobune

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:51.220
A small boat floats along the river

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:55.150
Doko ni yukuno darouka

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:55.150
I wonder where it's going

00:00:55.580 --> 00:01:00.340
Ikisaki nado yosou dekinu

00:00:55.580 --> 00:01:00.340
I can't even guess its destination

00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:04.620
Sorega omoshiroki koto

00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:04.620
But that's why it's so fun

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:13.760
Kokorozashi wa takaku mokuhyou wa hikuku

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:13.760
My intentions are high, but my goals are low

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:18.760
Aho wo mazerya kekka

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:18.760
When foolishness gets mixed in

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:26.440
Yukai ni nareru

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:26.440
Everything will be merry

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:32.580
Narugamama ni sawagu mama ni

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:32.580
As things will be, as chaotic as they will be

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:37.280
Toraburu suramo nenryou sa

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:37.280
Even troubles become fuel

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:41.750
Namikaze tatanai jinsei wa

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:41.750
A life lived without any strife

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:46.250
Chotto bakkari tsumaranai

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:46.250
Can be a bit boring

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:50.980
Okiraku ni gokuraku ni

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:50.980
Carefree and blissfully

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:55.530
Kaze ni makasete ikou

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:55.530
Let's let the wind lead us

00:01:55.530 --> 00:02:00.010
Kyou mo bakashite ikou

00:01:55.530 --> 00:02:00.010
Let's go trick everyone again today

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:03.010
<b>Episode Six
 Arima Hell</b>

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:10.370
Where are you off to?

00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:13.480
I'm going to hang out
with Professor Yodogawa.

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:15.290
Oh, I see.

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:17.280
Wait just a moment then.

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.910
Here, take this with you.

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:25.550
What's this?

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:27.390
Were you going to go empty-handed?

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:28.950
It's a gift.

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:31.220
He did save my life, after all.

00:02:31.220 --> 00:02:32.950
Be on your best behavior, now.

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:34.220
'Kay.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:40.220
It's a conspiracy.

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:42.370
I'm onto them.

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:46.860
It's a <i>coup d'état</i>
by the associate professors.

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:48.430
How did this happen?

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:52.020
The Friday Club is trying to get back at me.

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:54.800
So, they conspired against you

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:58.930
and got you kicked out of the university
because you made the Thursday Club?

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:01.950
The world of adults is a very scary place.

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:05.160
I can't tell if they're bored
or just plain immature.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:07.540
Do we raise the white flag, then?

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:09.270
What are you talking about?

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:11.710
We have to protect tanuki from hot pots!

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:13.830
I'm not disbanding the Thursday Club.

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:15.750
So I heard

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:20.550
that you threw "abolish tanuki hot pots"
flyers into a Friday Club gathering...

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:22.680
<b>Abolish Tanuki Hot Pots!</b>

00:03:21.320 --> 00:03:22.160
Yup.

00:03:22.850 --> 00:03:27.310
And then I went door-to-door to visit
each of the Friday Club members.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:31.270
So the Friday Club's conspiracy
is the backlash.

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:34.790
Suzuki-kun.

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:35.910
Huh?

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:38.030
What are you making there?

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:39.630
Oh, this bamboo spear?

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:44.170
If we're going to fight wild boars,
we need to be armed.

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:46.490
I-I see.

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:49.060
You're pretty wild.

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:57.920
<b>Kyoto University Research Forest</b>

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:57.920
<b>Beware of Wild Boars</b>

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:59.240
Hello!

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:01.110
Huh?

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:03.190
Yasaburo-kun.

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:09.010
Where did Professor Yodogawa head off to?

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:14.220
Actually, a suspicious-looking man
in a red shirt showed up this morning

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:16.270
and took him somewhere.

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:17.850
A red shirt?

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:27.410
Could it be Tenmaya?

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:31.570
That was the guy who was secretly meeting

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:35.450
with the dean and faculty right before
the Professor fell from grace.

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:37.740
I hope the Professor's all right.

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:41.610
I don't think the Friday Club would make
a hot pot out of a human.

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:43.210
Oh, right.

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:45.090
I have a message from the Professor.

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:46.890
What did he say?

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:51.200
The Friday Club will be gathering
at the Arima Onsen tonight.

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:54.340
Arima Onsen...

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:58.650
I've come to Arima.

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:02.150
<b>Arima Hon Onsen
Kin no Yu</b>

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:02.150
It would be rude of me
not to use the hot springs.

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:07.740
Ah, yes...

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:10.360
My butt's warming right up.

00:05:11.150 --> 00:05:12.640
This takes me back.

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:16.290
Father used to smell like this, too.

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:18.700
I'm back.

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:25.380
Is that you, Father?

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:26.370
Huh?

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:28.720
You don't smell like Father.

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:31.670
Sniff, sniff.

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:32.800
You're right.

00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:35.060
You're like a ghost, and it's creepy.

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:37.940
Oh, dear. You're right.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:38.910
Huh?

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:39.900
Really?

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:41.710
Yes!

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:46.280
A tanuki's scent is proof of his identity!

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:48.490
So currently,

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:51.860
I'm an unemployed and homeless tanuki.

00:05:52.600 --> 00:05:55.560
Honestly, this isn't a laughing matter!

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:57.620
The foolishness of tanuki

00:05:58.010 --> 00:06:01.010
never ceases to amaze me.

00:06:01.010 --> 00:06:02.580
Ah, Sensei.

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:03.710
Good evening.

00:06:04.270 --> 00:06:07.840
You went to a hot spring,
didn't you, Souichiro?

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:11.240
Yes, it was truly wonderful.

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:13.810
Honestly, the nerve of you...

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:14.740
Oh.

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:17.060
Do you not like hot springs, Sensei?

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:20.330
Staying in those things too long
will make you a fool.

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:24.150
Truly, hot springs are very foolish things.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:29.410
<b>Extremely Hot Bath
 Approximately 44°C</b>

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:28.860
I have discovered that heaven
is truly in the hot springs.

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:37.410
<b>Yuzu Tea</b>

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:39.040
Hey, you.

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:44.250
I don't remember giving
a sugar jar a bone to pick.

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:46.170
Don't touch me, damn it!

00:06:47.430 --> 00:06:50.380
What are you even doing here?

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:53.310
I'm allowed to go wherever I want.

00:06:53.310 --> 00:06:55.730
This is Arima Onsen.

00:06:55.730 --> 00:06:57.950
You don't need to tell me that.

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:02.760
Kureichiro-niisan was worried about my fur

00:07:02.760 --> 00:07:04.440
because I've been so busy lately.

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:08.910
Kureichiro-san is a very thoughtful tanuki.

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:11.510
Him and his brothers are like night and day.

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:13.650
Don't make fun of my brothers!

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:16.540
Which means that Kinkaku
and Ginkaku are here, too.

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:17.860
Yeah...

00:07:18.390 --> 00:07:20.890
But they drank themselves dead immediately.

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:24.180
And so you got bored
and jumped into a sugar jar?

00:07:24.180 --> 00:07:26.080
Keep your foolishness down, now.

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:27.020
Shut up!

00:07:27.020 --> 00:07:30.920
Unlike you, every day isn't Sunday for me!

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:34.840
I'm not here to play, either!

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:37.430
I'm here to stop the Friday Club's plot.

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.170
How stupid.

00:07:39.170 --> 00:07:43.110
So you came all the way to Arima
just to jump into a hot pot?

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:46.140
As if I'd mistake a hot pot for a hot spring!

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:50.170
I'm sure you've just got the hots
for that stupid tengu.

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:54.160
How crazy do you have to be to have the hots
for someone who eats tanuki hot pot?

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:55.820
You seriously piss me off.

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:58.390
If only the Nidaime
had finished the woman off.

00:07:58.390 --> 00:07:59.830
It'd all be peachy.

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:02.920
Watch what you say.

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:05.790
Benten-sama's here in Arima, too.

00:08:06.190 --> 00:08:07.290
Not to mention,

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:11.160
Benten-sama's been avoiding
the Nidaime since that day.

00:08:11.160 --> 00:08:11.930
Hmph.

00:08:11.930 --> 00:08:14.380
Keeping her tail between
her legs because she lost.

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:17.580
That's not exactly how I'd put it.

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:21.770
Benten-sama definitely has
the Nidaime on her mind.

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:24.050
Why don't you ask her in person?

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:27.730
I'm not so stupid as to
ask that to her face.

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:31.780
Benten-sama has a rage
that's somewhat manageable,

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:34.780
and a rage that means
you're seriously in trouble.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:39.060
For a mere tanuki involved
closely in her affairs,

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:42.120
telling the difference
between them is life or death.

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:44.710
The Nidaime issue
is definitely the latter.

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:48.840
You truly are a fool.

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:53.590
<b>Arima Tourist Souvenir Shop
Wakasaya</b>

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:10.280
Well, they all seem pretty carefree.

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:12.850
Seriously, go back to your inn already.

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:14.540
In a little bit.

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:29.120
I don't see Jyurojin.

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:30.580
Who's that?

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:33.310
He's the boss of the Friday Club,

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:35.590
and if you betray him,
you get sent to Hell.

00:09:36.110 --> 00:09:38.940
Benten-sama is yielding to him,

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:41.260
so he's definitely not a normal human being.

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:43.090
Bet you're jealous.

00:09:43.090 --> 00:09:45.120
Would you stop with the nonsense?

00:09:57.140 --> 00:09:59.550
You're trying to sneak
into a place like this?

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:02.410
Seriously, go back to your inn,

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:02.120
Ow!

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:04.580
warm up your behind, and relax.

00:10:24.740 --> 00:10:26.150
Is that you, Yasaburo?

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:31.270
Who are you?

00:10:34.130 --> 00:10:35.530
Come over here.

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:40.110
You don't smell like Father.

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:45.580
A tanuki's scent is proof of his identity!

00:10:47.560 --> 00:10:49.930
So this is where you've been hiding.

00:11:04.880 --> 00:11:06.460
Have a drink.

00:11:14.180 --> 00:11:16.320
I'm celebrating a little early.

00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:19.950
That traitor Professor Yodogawa's
been banished,

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:23.160
so there's an opening in the Friday Club.

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:25.660
And tonight,

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:29.330
a new member will be welcomed into the club.

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:34.880
Do you know who that is?

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:38.620
I guess you don't.

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:41.380
It's me.

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:44.330
You're going to eat a fellow tanuki?

00:11:44.730 --> 00:11:47.760
Soun, that's going too far, even for you.

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:49.790
As if I care!

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:53.520
I've quit being a tanuki.

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:56.120
My great brother managed

00:11:56.120 --> 00:12:00.230
to destroy all my prospects in this lifetime,

00:12:00.230 --> 00:12:05.120
baited me around, and got poor little old me
kicked out of tanuki life.

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:06.780
How dare you?!

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:10.250
You kicked Father out of life itself!

00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:17.250
One day, you'll understand, Yasaburo.

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:21.660
You'll all walk down the same path as me.

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:27.080
I would expect nothing less
from Jyurojin's own painting of Hell.

00:12:27.610 --> 00:12:31.480
Doesn't it feel as though you'll be blown
away by the winds of Hell at any moment?

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:39.360
Would you like to see what Hell is like?

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:52.080
<b>Izumi</b>

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:52.080
<b>Kin no Yu</b>

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:52.080
<b>Round Postal Box</b>

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:52.080
<b>Leisure Home</b>

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:14.720
What the hell is this?

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:26.950
Hey!

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:29.010
Is anyone here?

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:03.400
<b>Box Office</b>

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:11.880
Man, that stinks!

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:19.120
Huh?

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:26.070
What the hell is this place?

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:46.990
This is...

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:52.120
<b>Ramen</b>

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:27.980
An oni?!

00:15:28.390 --> 00:15:30.130
Curse that Soun!

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:31.570
How could he do this?!

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:34.340
Hey, there's a human.

00:15:34.340 --> 00:15:37.160
What? Where'd he escape from?

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:38.720
Who the hell cares?

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:41.580
Tie him up and throw him
into a boiling pot!

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:43.300
Hold it!

00:15:43.300 --> 00:15:45.540
Damn it! Where do you belong?

00:15:45.800 --> 00:15:47.830
Give it up!

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:49.670
We're gonna get ya!

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:54.800
Hey, did ya see a runty li'l human pass by?

00:15:55.710 --> 00:15:56.880
Yeah.

00:15:56.880 --> 00:15:59.560
He ran through there.

00:15:57.810 --> 00:15:59.560
<b>Tenmaya {backwards}</b>

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:01.390
That fast little runt.

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:03.140
He ain't gettin' away from us!

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:18.950
<b>Tenmaya</b>

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:21.710
<b>Oni Beer</b>

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:21.710
<b>Oni Rice Big</b>

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:21.710
<b>Oni Rice Small</b>

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:21.710
<b>Oni Spicy Ramen</b>

00:16:19.360 --> 00:16:20.580
Tenmaya...

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:29.710
<b>Curse that Jyurojin</b>

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:29.710
<b>A body that's better than theirs!!</b>

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:29.710
<b>My flower <3</b>

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:29.710
<b>Damn it</b>

00:16:22.380 --> 00:16:26.360
True, she's completely out of my league!

00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:29.350
So that's what you meant, Tenmaya-san.

00:16:30.140 --> 00:16:32.100
Give me one ramen.

00:16:32.480 --> 00:16:35.510
Oh, sorry. We're not open right now.

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:37.640
Oh, that's too bad.

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:40.220
What happened to Old Man Tenmaya?

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:42.880
He ran off somewhere.

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:45.310
Damn it! It must've been the spider's thread!

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:48.370
That bastard. Weaseled his damned way out.

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:48.860
Tch.

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:50.130
Hey.

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:52.740
It's about time.

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:54.310
Got it.

00:16:54.850 --> 00:16:56.700
Is something going on?

00:16:56.960 --> 00:16:59.180
Huh? You don't know?

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:00.780
Er, sorry...

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:02.410
I'm not from around here.

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:05.000
Oh, are you from Burning Hell?

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:06.690
Or Uninterrupted Hell?

00:17:06.690 --> 00:17:08.840
Er, yeah, somewhere around there.

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:13.150
Yeah, I worked my way up
from pots to engineer, you know.

00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:15.760
Were you surprised when you got here?

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:17.520
You have no idea.

00:17:17.520 --> 00:17:20.540
This is the industrial revolution
that everyone's talking about.

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:22.720
Talk about hard times.

00:17:26.070 --> 00:17:31.370
You know, we don't see
muscly guys like you nowadays!

00:17:31.370 --> 00:17:32.820
Not bad!

00:17:33.670 --> 00:17:35.570
Thanks...

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:38.000
You might just make it.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:40.180
This is definitely your chance.

00:17:40.180 --> 00:17:41.450
I'll lead you over.

00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:57.000
Boiling up oni and the souls of the dead
together like they do down in the sticks?

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:58.760
Now that's just uncivilized.

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:01.030
I-I see...

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:04.270
Now that you've worked your way up
from the depths of Hell,

00:18:04.270 --> 00:18:06.020
you've gotta learn steam engines

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:09.600
and catch up to
the industrial revolution of Hell.

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:12.150
"Steam engines," you say?

00:18:12.390 --> 00:18:15.150
You really don't know anything, do you?

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:17.900
Fur pants are totally out of style now,

00:18:18.270 --> 00:18:20.380
but I think it's pretty manly

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:23.310
that you don't get
dragged along with the times.

00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:25.540
Thanks.

00:18:25.790 --> 00:18:29.960
I guess it's true that not all oni are bad.

00:18:31.320 --> 00:18:32.920
You sure are strange.

00:18:39.080 --> 00:18:40.600
Good job!

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:40.890
<b>Thanks for the full house</b>

00:18:40.600 --> 00:18:45.680
Sometimes, celestial maidens come down
and compete against the oni in sumo.

00:18:55.840 --> 00:18:56.530
Be—

00:19:07.110 --> 00:19:08.810
Put your back into it!

00:19:15.390 --> 00:19:16.880
Grapple harder!

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:27.260
Come on!

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:36.610
Isn't that pretty embarrassing?

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:39.350
You should try fighting her, too.

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:41.110
You've got nothing to lose.

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:57.930
Get her!

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:02.860
It's been a while, Benten-sama.

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:04.300
It's me, Yasaburo.

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:14.220
To think you'd chase me this far...

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:16.860
Are you planning to bury your fur here?

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:21.860
Actually, my uncle kicked me
into a painting of Hell.

00:20:22.120 --> 00:20:23.660
You must be joking!

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:25.620
How pathetic can you be?

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:01.920
I come down once in a while
to gather some oni horns.

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:04.530
It makes for a great workout.

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:07.370
Thanks to you, I can return
to the mortal world.

00:21:07.600 --> 00:21:11.700
Knowing you, you could've lived
a merry life in Hell, too.

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:13.410
Please don't even joke about that.

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:16.500
I can't wait to get back to the mortal world.

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:29.830
Hold your breath for a while.

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:31.600
It's an awful smell.

00:21:33.400 --> 00:21:36.870
<i>The phrase "from Heaven to Hell"
is quite fitting here.</i>

00:21:37.500 --> 00:21:42.550
<i>I was literally thrown into Hell
from the heaven known as Arima.</i>

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:45.260
<i>It was at this moment</i>

00:21:45.260 --> 00:21:48.810
<i>that I discovered the cause
of the eerie rumblings</i>

00:21:48.810 --> 00:21:50.290
<i>resonating through the world.</i>

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:09.350
Tsuki wo medetewa toki ni wa nusunde

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:09.350
While gazing lovingly at the 
moon, at times, she steals it

00:22:09.350 --> 00:22:14.180
Kimagure na kanojo wa ah

00:22:09.350 --> 00:22:14.180
Whimsical as she may be, ah

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:18.650
Kawabe de hitori hoho ni namida

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:18.650
As she stands by the riverside 
alone, secretly her tears

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:23.000
Utsukushiku tayutau

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:23.000
Quiver beautifully upon her cheeks

00:22:23.000 --> 00:22:34.790
Boku no te tori nagara 
kokoro wa dokoka ni ukabu

00:22:23.000 --> 00:22:34.790
She takes my hand, as her 
heart floats away somewhere

00:22:34.790 --> 00:22:39.290
Kasaneta te ni wa mada nukumori

00:22:34.790 --> 00:22:39.290
I still feel that warmth from her held hand

00:22:39.290 --> 00:22:43.670
Setsunai yume no sono ato saki

00:22:39.290 --> 00:22:43.670
Somewhere beyond this sentimental dream

00:22:43.670 --> 00:22:53.290
Demo kimi no me wa harukana 
mirai wo miteitane

00:22:43.670 --> 00:22:53.290
But you were already looking 
far into the future

00:22:53.290 --> 00:22:57.960
Zutto zutto oikaketayo

00:22:53.290 --> 00:22:57.960
I always chased after you

00:22:57.960 --> 00:23:02.310
Kimi ga kizutsuku toki mo

00:22:57.960 --> 00:23:02.310
Even when you were hurt

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:11.680
Sotto mabuta ni yakitsuita kimi no sugata ni

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:11.680
The vision of you that's 
softly imprinted on my eyes

00:23:11.680 --> 00:23:16.600
Ima mata tooku e to ah

00:23:11.680 --> 00:23:16.600
Once again, you fly far away, ah

00:23:16.600 --> 00:23:29.040
Tondeiku kimi wa hora Kanata no hito

00:23:16.600 --> 00:23:29.040
You are a person far beyond

00:23:31.120 --> 00:23:34.480
The time has finally arrived.

00:23:34.480 --> 00:23:37.390
I will get my revenge on them!

00:23:37.390 --> 00:23:39.900
I will deal the crushing blow!

00:23:37.810 --> 00:23:40.060
<b>Episode Seven
The Friday Club Once More</b>
